    LLM: "Avoid winning the last trick. Dump high cards when you can; try to force others to take final tricks.\n\nTrack which high cards are out; time your plays so you don't hold the last high card.\n\nIn multi-card tricks, sometimes playing lowest to avoid leading the next trick is better than winning.",
